lass="MuiAccordionSummary-content mui-1n11r91">How much do SAP Software Engineer employees get paid in Germany?</div><div class="MuiAccordionSummary-expandIconWrapper mui-1fx8m19"><svg class="svg-inline--fa fa-chevron-down fa-w-16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 512 512" role="img"><path fill="currentColor" d="M233.4 406.6c12.5 12.5 32.8 12.5 45.3 0l192-192c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3s-32.8-12.5-45.3 0L256 338.7 86.6 169.4c-12.5-12.5-32.8-12.5-45.3 0s-12.5 32.8 0 45.3l192 192z"></path></svg></div></div><div class="MuiCollapse-root MuiCollapse-vertical MuiCollapse-hidden mui-a0y2e3" style="min-height:0px"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapper MuiCollapse-vertical mui-hboir5"><div class="MuiCollapse-wrapperInner MuiCollapse-vertical mui-8atqhb"><div aria-labelledby="faq-question-2" role="region" class="MuiAccordion-region"><div class="MuiAccordionDetails-root company-page-faqs-module-scss-module__gC3AdW__accordionDetails mui-u7qq7e">The median yearly total compensation reported at SAP for the Software Engineer role in Germany is €64,417.</div></div></div></div></div></div><div class="MuiPaper-root MuiPaper-elevation MuiPaper-rounded MuiPaper-elevation1 MuiAccordion-root MuiAccordion-rounded company-page-faqs-module-scss-module__gC3AdW__accordion mui-d9r78q"><div class="MuiButtonBase-root MuiAccordionSummary-root company-page-faqs-module-scss-module__gC3AdW__accordionSummary mui-11lrv4s" tabindex="0" role="button" aria-expanded="false" id="faq-question-3"><div class="MuiAccordionSummary-content mui-1n11r91">How can I negotiate a higher Software Engineer offer at SAP?</div><div class="MuiAccordionSummary-expandIconWrapper mui-1fx8m19"><svg class="svg-inline--fa fa-chevron-down fa-w-16" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 512 512" role="img"><path fill="currentColor" d="M233.4 406.6c12.5 12.5 32.8 12.5 45.3 0l192-192c12.5-12.5 12.5-32.8 0-45.3s-32.8-12.5-45.3 0L256 338.7 86.6 